Neapolitan Orbit Cream Crunch 🚀🍓🍫🍦

&nbsp;

Classic ice cream. Cosmic twist. ✨

&nbsp;

Our **Neapolitan Orbit Cream Crunch** takes the nostalgic flavor of Neapolitan ice cream sandwiches — chocolate, vanilla, and strawberry — and launches them into an *entirely new galaxy of snacking*. Freeze-dried to perfection, each bite is crunchy, airy, and melt-in-your-mouth delicious.

&nbsp;

Perfect for:

<ul>	<li>	Road trips and camping adventures 🌲🔥

	</li>	<li>	School lunches and after-school treats 🎒

	</li>	<li>	Late-night sweet tooth cravings 🌙

	</li>	<li>	Anyone who loves unique, gourmet freeze-dried snacks!

	</li></ul>&nbsp;

No freezer required. No sticky mess.

&nbsp;

Just pure, space-worthy flavor that kids and adults both love.

Take your taste buds on orbit with this cosmic classic — because why settle for ordinary when you can snack among the stars? 🌌

&nbsp;

🌀 **Stay curious. Stay crunchy. Stay cosmic.**

**-Torus Coffee Company**
